.TH geectl-branch-set-link-rev-project 1  "geectl-branch-set-link-rev-project 0.2.3" 
.SH NAME
geectl\-branch\-set\-link\-rev\-project \- Set the revision every linked package in a project expands at. A mutation: dry\-run is the default
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBgeectl branch set\-link\-rev\-project\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fB\-\-project\fR> <\fB\-\-revision\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Set the revision every linked package in a project expands at. A mutation: dry\-run is the default
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-project\fR \fI<PROJECT>\fR
The project whose linked packages to set
.TP
\fB\-\-revision\fR \fI<REVISION>\fR
The revision: `latest`, `expanded`, or `unset`. A pinned revision needs a package: use `set\-link\-rev` for one package at a time
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH VERSION
v0.2.3
